WEBVTT

00:18.400 --> 00:22.640
Brother brother brother.

00:24.080 --> 00:27.960
Shilang Xuan reinforcements have arrived brother should we retreat?

00:29.040 --> 00:30.707
Let me kill him first.

00:31.760 --> 00:37.480
Shilang immediately organize your troops to withdraw this is Chanyu Ayidai's order the Yiyang battle is decided.

00:37.560 --> 00:42.960
If you can properly bring your troops back you and your clansmen can still avoid the death penalty.

00:43.040 --> 00:44.440
Retreat.

00:44.520 --> 00:46.800
Boy state your name.

